 "description": "control.req_sample_rate sample_rate is 5 Hz; the relaxed minimum is 50 Hz. The robot is an inverted pendulum about 0.12 m tall (R11.02), with a time constant of roughly sqrt(L/g), about 0.1 s, so it falls over in a few tenths of a second. A 5 Hz minimum allows 200 ms between updates, about two time constants, which is not plausible for stabilising this robot. The tilt estimator and balance loop would still meet it at 100 Hz, so the requirement no longer bounds anything.",
